 "lessons": [
  {
   "text": "Add, Save and Forward exist only on the Header Info tab. Switching back to Header Info after saving a line resets the header to a blank new form; reopen the DA from the grid (filter on Document No) before Forward.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/PILOT-DA-GIN/20260930-1615/friction.md (A2-2)",
   "date": "2026-09-30"
  },
  {
   "text": "Add a line with a real click on the grid toolbar .dx-datagrid-addrow-button. Row inputs: prodCode_0 (type-ahead: real keys, then a real click on the option), quantity1_0 (CS); row save rowEditBtn_Save_0. Stock type and batch fill automatically: type the quantity only after they have filled.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/PILOT-DA-GIN/20260930-1615/friction.md (A2-1); knowledge/business/LIVE_FINDINGS.md (cycle step 1)",
   "date": "2026-10-01"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Forward popup Save is the dx-button inside div#forwardPopUpSaveBtn; the #save inside it duplicates the id of the main Save.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/PILOT-DA-GIN/20260930-1615/friction.md (R4)",
   "date": "2026-09-30"
  },
  {
   "text": "The grid row filter (gridFilterCheckbox + Document No) stays set after approval and after reopening the screen; check aria-checked before toggling it.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/PILOT-DA-GIN/20260930-1615/friction.md (A2-6)",
   "date": "2026-09-30"
  },
  {
   "text": "After Add the form resets with Warehouse, Vendor Code and DA Type empty; Save with DA Type empty does nothing (no toast, only an inline invalid mark).",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "knowledge/business/LIVE_FINDINGS.md (L11)",
   "date": "2026-10-01"
  },
  {
   "text": "Loss entry: the '+' in the Loss cell (row in edit mode) opens a modal; its row save is rowEditBtn_Modal_Save_0; closing the modal with the x discards the loss.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "knowledge/business/LIVE_FINDINGS.md (L12)",
   "date": "2026-10-01"
  },
  {
   "text": "Grid row Save/Edit links must be scrolled into view before a click (otherwise 'element not interactable').",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "knowledge/business/LIVE_FINDINGS.md (L12)",
   "date": "2026-10-01"
  },
  {
   "text": "The form Status stays 'Draft' after Forward until a reload; read the Approval Status from the grid instead.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/PILOT-DA-GIN/20260930-1615/friction.md (A2-4)",
   "date": "2026-09-30"
  }
 ],
